        "text": "Senator Abiola Ajimobi Foundation Educational Grant 2026\n\nApplication for Senator Abiola Ajimobi Foundation Educational Grant is Open.\n\nBenefits\nFinancial support for university, polythenic and college of education students \nOpportunity to excel academically and make a postive impact on the society.\nEmpowernment to achieve your full potential \nSelected applicants will be offered an educational grant of N150,000\n\nDeadline: Not Specified\n\nApply Now\nhttps://www.scholarshipair.com/s/10269",
