        "speaker": "Maryjaneey",
        "role": "participant",
        "text": "Commonwealth Shared Masters Scholarship in UK 2027/2028\n\nApplications for Commonwealth Shared Scholarships for the 2027/28 academic year will open on Tuesday 10 November 2026. The scholarships are for study in the UK beginning in September/October 2027.\n\nBenefits\nTuition fee\nTravel expenses\nLiving allowance\nThesis grant\n\nDeadline: December 8, 2026\n\nApply Now\nhttps://www.scholarshipair.com/s/10270",
