        "text": "EFCC Recruitment Application 2026\n\nThe Economic and Financial Crimes Commission is inviting qualified Nigerians to apply for positions across four cadres, this is an opportunity for you to apply. \n\nGeneral Requirements\nBe a Nigerian citizen.\nPossess basic computer skills.\nDeclare all academic and professional qualifications during the application.\nBe medically fit and provide evidence of fitness from a government-approved hospital.\nHave no tattoos on any part of the body.\nHave no criminal record.\n\nDeadline: 1st November, 2026\n\nApply Now\nhttps://www.scholarshipair.com/s/10271",
