        "speaker": "Maryjaneey",
        "role": "participant",
        "text": "Awareness Africa Education Fund 2026/2027 (University Scholarship)\n\nThe Awareness Africa Education Fund is a need-based scholarship created to support a Nigerian student commencing undergraduate studies at a federal or state university in the 2026/2027 academic session.\n\nBenefits\nThe scholarship will provide financial support of up to N500,000 towards school fees and compulsory registration fees.\n\nDeadline: 31st October,2026\n\nApply Now\nhttps://www.scholarshipair.com/s/10272",
